{
  "_note": "Official Grok Bot 0.78.1's theme tokens for the '连接应用' plugins dialog, captured from the official app. The dark column is official's computed value on the live dialog; the light column is official's own light palette block, except for the theme-independent typography metrics. The --cursor-* colour rows are official's own forwarding to --sand-*, reproduced verbatim; the --cursor-font-size-* rows are official's own literal font sizes, theme-independent.",
  "_source": {
    "official": "Grok Bot 0.78.1 (com.anysphere.sand)",
    "officialAsarSha256": "e8d5e10f94f8b52cd02f696599c8e6503420ad85ceed7b41a27bbff7bff22f4d",
    "dark": "official 0.78.1 running app — computed custom properties on the live 连接应用 dialog (theme cursor-dark)",
    "light": "rea-grokbot-0781/app/dist/renderer/assets/index-Dh7EWA8t.css — the `:root,.sand-1vbcnu7` palette block",
    "typography": "theme-independent in official (its stylesheet declares the sand font sizes at `:root,.sand-1hqobez`, the line heights at `:root,.sand-i7i3ao` and the cursor font sizes at `:root,.ui-qruemj`, all outside any theme selector)"
  },
  "_notes": {
    "--sand-border-focus-primary": "official's palette declares a colour, but official's `:root:not([data-sand-keyboard-nav])` rule forces `transparent!important` while keyboard navigation is off, and upstream 0.18 ships no such rule. The rendered value is captured.",
    "--cursor-*": "official forwards the whole `--cursor-*` family to `--sand-*`. A custom property's `var()` is substituted where the property is DECLARED, so upstream's `:root` forwarding is already computed against upstream's palette and cannot be reached by overriding `--sand-*` on the dialog. The same forwarding is re-declared on the dialog, against the dialog's own `--sand-*` values.",
    "initial": "the four tokens official leaves undefined are reset to `initial`, the guaranteed-invalid value, so that upstream's definitions do not render where official renders nothing.",
    "--cursor-font-size-*": "official's own literal cursor font sizes, declared at `:root,.ui-qruemj` outside any theme selector, so they are the same in both themes. The ported section-title rule `sand-fc7y3v` reads `var(--cursor-font-size-lg)`. Upstream 0.18 declares the same four values, but the port declares them so the rule does not depend on upstream's palette.",
    "--sand-bg-elevated-hover/--sand-bg-chrome/--sand-bg-sidebar/--sand-bg-luminous": "declared by official and by neither upstream 0.18 nor an earlier revision of this block; reproduced with official's own values so a surface inside the dialog that reads them cannot fall back to an unset token."
  },
